   Runs the Chat Server                                     Connects to your Chat
   Tailscale IP: 100.75.12.3                                Opens: http://100.75.12.3:3000
              │                                                        ▲
              └────────────────( Secure Internet Tunnel )──────────────┘
```

1. You install a free, lightweight tool called **Tailscale** on your router (or home computer).
2. Your friend installs Tailscale on their router or phone.
3. Tailscale gives your router a special, permanent private IP (for example: **`100.75.12.3`**).
4. No matter where your friend is in the world, they just open their browser, type **`http://100.75.12.3:3000`**, and your chat interface loads!
